OL,3,AHundreds more prisoners being freed in
OL,4,Asecond phase of early release scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 650 more offenders are leaving
OL,7,Fjails in England and Wales on Tuesday,
OL,8,Fin the second phase of the government's
OL,9,Fplan to tackle the prison population
OL,10,Fcrisis.
OL,12,FThe group includes offenders serving up
OL,13,Fto two and a half years for crimes.
OL,15,FUnder the new rules, they are leaving
OL,16,Fjail after serving a third of their
OL,17,Fsentence behind bars, rather than half.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
