OL,3,AHundreds more prisoners being freed in
OL,4,Asecond phase of early release scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe second wave of releases comes as
OL,7,Fthe government takes its plan to
OL,8,Fradically overhaul criminal courts back
OL,9,Fto Parliament - but also as probation
OL,10,Fofficers prepare to vote in a ballot
OL,11,Fthat could lead to a strike over pay
OL,12,Fand workload.
